Everphone operates a B2B Device-as-a-Service platform for corporate smartphones and tablets, circulating devices across multiple rental cycles. Core strategy: Reduce (combine professional/private use via MDM), Reuse (refurbished returns), Refurbish (99% recovery rate). Each refurbished smartphone saves 58 kg CO2 versus new production. The model shifts enterprise CapEx to OpEx, meets ESG reporting requirements, and aligns profitability with extended lifecycle. Series C funding of EUR 270M (Jan 2024) accelerates European and US expansion.